---
source: tests/config.rs
expression: lines
---
-boot: ginary boots the runtime from the bundled bin/no_dot_erlang
-extra: everything after -extra is the packaged application's own arguments
-noshell: ginary always starts the runtime with -noshell
-pa: the code path is built from the applications ginary bundles
-pz: the code path is built from the applications ginary bundles
